# Faunsbane Troll: "When this creature enters, create a Monster Role token attached to it." and "{1}, Sacrifice an Aura attached to this
# creature: This creature fights target creature you don't control. If that creature would die this turn, exile it instead. Activate
# only as a sorcery." Turn 1: the Troll (4/4) enters and the Monster Role makes it a 5/5 with trample, off Jet, Emerald, Ruby and Pearl.
# During Bot2's end step of turn 2 the ability is refused (sorcery speed, CR 307.5). On turn 3, Bot1's own Memnite is no legal target
# (the creature must be one you don't control); Pearl's {1} pays exactly and the Role is sacrificed: the Troll is 4/4 again, fights Bot2's
# Memnite, takes 1 damage, and the dying Memnite is exiled instead of going to the graveyard.

